#: ../../getting_started/functionality/agent/osSupport.rst:4
msgid ""
"RHEL 6 is not supported for standard |morpheus| Agent installation. The "
"minimum supported RHEL version is not established by the bundled package "
"metadata; an OS-recognition row must not be treated as a support promise."
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/functionality/agent/osSupport.rst:6
msgid ""
"RHEL 10 Agent installation is supported beginning with |morpheus| 8.0.8. "
"This is an Agent support statement and does not describe the operating "
"systems supported for the |morpheus| appliance. No different RHEL 10 "
"floor is established here for later release lines."
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/functionality/agent/osSupport.rst:8
#, fuzzy
msgid "Warning"
msgstr "darwin"

#: ../../getting_started/functionality/agent/osSupport.rst:8
msgid ""
"The table below is the operating-system recognition catalog used by "
"|morpheus|. It is not a current package support or lifecycle matrix. In "
"particular, a recognized OS code or an **Install Agent?** value of ``1`` "
"does not prove that a package is published for the current release. "
"General 32-bit Linux support is not established by current bundled "
"package metadata. Historical Debian and Ubuntu recognition rows likewise "
"do not establish current support; consult release history for removals "
"and the target release's package policy for current availability. Use a "
"package published for the target architecture and release, and treat an "
"OS/version not listed in that policy as not listed as supported rather "
"than inferring compatibility from this catalog."
msgstr ""

